# Cloudflare DNS for thaivisaexperts.com — applied by .github/workflows/dns.yml
# (idempotent upsert via scripts/cloudflare-dns.sh). Replaces the old Wix records.
#
# name                       type   content            proxied
#
# GitHub Pages (pages.yml) serves the apex; apps/web/public/CNAME holds the
# custom domain. The apex CNAME is served by Cloudflare CNAME flattening, and
# Pages redirects www to the apex. Keep proxied=false (grey cloud) or the Pages
# TLS certificate cannot issue.
#
# NOT here: MX/SPF/DKIM for Cloudflare Email Routing (hello@ forwarding).
# Cloudflare manages and locks those records itself.
thaivisaexperts.com          CNAME  bwalia.github.io   false
www.thaivisaexperts.com      CNAME  bwalia.github.io   false
